# Agnes 2.5 Flash — findings by Ernie 5.5 Flash

- Source: Agnes AI/Agnes 2.5 Flash (`agnes-2.5-flash`)
- Date: 2026-11-13 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Agnes 2.5 Flash
- **Short description:** Agnes AI's July 2026 generally-available upgrade of Agnes 2.0 Flash — an API-only model focused on coding, agent workflows, tool calling and image understanding, positioned as a free/indefinite-cost tier for everyday development.
- **Provider / access:** Agnes API (`https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1`, model `agnes-2.5-flash`) with OpenAI Chat Completions, Responses and Anthropic Messages compatibility; aihubmix gateway ($0.03/$0.15). No open weights.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-07; knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `agnes-2.5-flash`; the Base checkpoint (`Agnes-2.5-Flash-Base`, ~190 GB FP8) exists on Hugging Face but the served model is the API checkpoint.
- **Context window:** 512K tokens; max output 65.5K.
- **Modalities:** text and image (public `image_url`) in, text out; thinking mode (`enable_thinking` / Anthropic `thinking.budget_tokens`); tool calling (`tools`/`tool_choice`); streaming; JSON via OpenAI-compatible structured output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** $0.05 in / $0.15 out per 1M, cached input $0.005 — free during the Angel User trial / free-tier promotion; aihubmix $0.03/$0.15.
- **Architecture:** undisclosed (sparse MoE per the Base repo landing page; served checkpoint proprietary).

### Raw benchmarks found

> No vendor benchmark table exists for this model. Agnes's docs and the third-party trackers (modelbenchmark.io, LLM Releases) carry no per-benchmark rows; a Chinese hands-on review (aiinking.com) reports only qualitative coding tests, explicitly claiming "SWE Atlas" improvement over 2.0 Flash without publishing a number.

Agent / tool use:

- Terminal-Bench 2.1 / Tau2 / GDPval / Claw-Eval / Toolathon: no verified public score found
- Tool calling supported (`tools`/`tool_choice`, multi-step agent workflows per vendor docs); no agentic benchmark row published

Reasoning / knowledge:

- GPQA / HLE / MMLU-Pro / AA Intelligence Index: no verified public score found
- Thinking mode with adjustable budget is the only reasoning-related spec published

Coding:

- SWE-bench Verified / SWE Atlas / LiveCodeBench / DeepSWE: no verified public score found — the aiinking.com review claims SWE Atlas gains vs 2.0 Flash but publishes no value

Long context:

- 512K declared; no MRCR / RULER / GraphWalks row published.

