## Search notes (why self-excluded)

- Agnes's own docs (wiki.agnes-ai.com) publish specs, endpoints and pricing but **zero benchmark rows**.
- modelbenchmark.io carries the spec sheet (512K ctx, $0/free pricing, text+image in) and no scores; LLM Releases has no Agnes 2.5 entry with figures.
- The aiinking.com hands-on review (2026-07-16) is qualitative only (bug-fix, full-stack build, refactor demos) and names "SWE Atlas" without a number — not a usable benchmark row.
- BenchLM: no profile (404, prior pass). The Agnes 3.0 Flash Preview table (GPQA 85.05 etc.) is a different checkpoint and was deliberately **not** transferred.
- Resolution: catalog-verified specs above; every score column stays empty until Agnes publishes a per-benchmark table for this exact ID.

